two commands force both steps.

215
00:16:35,458 --> 00:16:39,730
Between the steps the object still
exists and git fsck finds it.

216
00:16:40,070 --> 00:16:44,342
A backup ref before a risky operation
makes the operation reversible with one

217
00:16:44,382 --> 00:16:45,686
command and no deadline.

218
00:16:46,026 --> 00:16:50,885
A bundle is refs and objects in one file;
I verify it, and I know it holds no

